abstract: >-
  ColdGuard reconstructs right-censored model lifecycles, estimates coherent
  multi-horizon revival risk, and qualifies GPU model-residency actions in
  finite-capacity cloud MaaS platforms using explicit maturity, expiry, and
  abstention conditions.
keywords:
  - cloud computing
  - model-as-a-service
  - GPU resource management
  - model residency
  - survival analysis
  - risk qualification
